# EtelAudit Pro -- real files here (proxy.php, api.php, index.html, etc.)
# are already served directly by the parent .htaccess's
# "RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} -f" rule, so no rewrite override is
# needed here. A previous "RewriteEngine Off" in this file caused
# LiteSpeed to instead funnel these requests into the parent app's
# router (which has no route for them), producing 404s on proxy.php
# and api.php even though the files existed and were readable.
DirectoryIndex index.html
Options -Indexes
